---
import models from '../data/models.json';
import { pricingRange } from '../lib/model-pricing.mjs';
import RecordedTime from './RecordedTime.astro';
const range = pricingRange(models);
---
<details class="mb-6 rounded-lg border border-neon-amber/30 bg-neon-amber/5 p-4 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
  <summary class="cursor-pointer"><strong class="text-text-primary">Model data.</strong> {range.first ? <>Verified-price snapshots from <RecordedTime value={range.first} relative={false} />.</> : 'No verified price snapshot.'} Details</summary>
  <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
    <p>{range.count} of {models.length} tracked models have verified token rates in the saved catalogue. Rates come from the <a href="https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models" class="text-neon-cyan underline underline-offset-4">OpenRouter public API</a>. Models missing from that catalogue have unknown pricing and are excluded from cost estimates and chat selection.</p>
    {range.first !== range.last && range.last && <p>Newest pricing check: <RecordedTime value={range.last} relative={false} />.</p>}
    <p>Rates are USD per million text tokens. Caching, reasoning tokens, images, tool charges, provider routing and long-context tiers can change the bill. Check the provider before budgeting.</p>
    <p>Context windows and capability notes are saved reference values. Capability scores are editorial opinions, not SOFT CAT benchmark results. Open weights do not make a hosted API or self-hosting free.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/valorifutures/softcat.ai/blob/main/src/data/models.json" class="text-neon-cyan underline underline-offset-4">Inspect the dated data</a> · <a href="/pipeline" class="text-neon-cyan underline underline-offset-4">Bot records</a></p>
  </div>
</details>
